#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:5 f7c085d92b354dbbad8a58ce2a32fbab
msgid "AUTO Mode"
msgstr "AUTO 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:7 da7fb40431f34aef82992e07fea6d359
msgid ""
"In AUTO mode Plane will follow a mission (a set of GPS waypoints and other "
"commands) set by your ground station. When re-entering AUTO mode Plane will "
"continue from whatever mission item it was last doing, unless you have reset"
" the mission. If the mission ends with an item that does not continue "
"indefinitely (like LOITER UNLIMITED), an RTL will be executed."
msgstr ""
"在 AUTO 模式下，Plane 将按照地面站设置的任务（一组 GPS 航点和其他命令）飞行。重新进入 AUTO 模式时，Plane "
"将从上次执行的任务项继续，除非已重置任务。如果任务以不会无限持续的项目结束（如 LOITER UNLIMITED），将执行 RTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:12 b407a939166c4cdeb54efda61db6c346
msgid ""
"When in AUTO Plane will by default allow the pilot to influence the flight "
"of the plane by using \"stick mixing\", which allows for aileron, elevator "
"and rudder input to steer the plane in a way that can override the autopilot"
" control. Whether this is enabled is determined by the :ref:`STICK_MIXING "
"<STICK_MIXING>` option. By default stick mixing behaves the same as "
":ref:`FLY BY WIRE_A (FBWA) <fbwa-mode>` mode."
msgstr ""
"在 AUTO 模式下，Plane 默认允许飞手通过「摇杆混控」影响飞行，允许副翼、升降舵和方向舵输入以可覆盖飞控控制的方式操控飞机。是否启用由 "
":ref:`STICK_MIXING <STICK_MIXING>` 选项决定。默认情况下，摇杆混控行为与 :ref:`FLY BY WIRE_A "
"(FBWA) <fbwa-mode>` 模式相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:19 61990f531ac54bf19b697940c8f96af5
msgid ""
"The speed during the mission is nominally at "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` when using an airspeed sensor, or at"
" whatever speed results from :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` without an "
"airspeed sensor. Setting :ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` = 1 allows "
"the speed to be increased if the throttle stick is above mid-stick up to "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` or :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`, when using or "
"not using an airspeed sensor, respectively."
msgstr ""
"任务中的速度在使用空速传感器时名义上为 :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`，不使用空速传感器时为 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 产生的速度。将 "
":ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` = 1 可在使用或不使用空速传感器时分别将速度增加到 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` 或 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` （当油门摇杆高于中位时）。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:23 a679390cf5b9444c8db6239b625a93c0
msgid ""
"\"Home\" position is always supposed to be your Plane's actual GPS takeoff "
"location:"
msgstr "「Home」位置应始终是您的 Plane 实际 GPS 起飞位置："

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:26 1916f24c33184388a1107dd8b2381cea
msgid ""
"It is very important to acquire GPS lock before arming in order for RTL, "
"Loiter, Auto or any GPS dependent mode to work properly."
msgstr "非常重要的是，在解锁前获得 GPS 定位，以确保 RTL、Loiter、Auto 或任何 GPS 依赖模式正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:28 fd46c81fd35642c0a5b0c14c12652233
msgid ""
"For Plane the home position is initially established at the time the plane "
"acquires its GPS lock. It is then continuously updated as long as the "
"autopilot is disarmed."
msgstr "对于 Plane，Home 位置最初在飞机获取 GPS 定位时建立。此后，只要飞控处于上锁状态，Home 位置将持续更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:32 b29dbf97efdf41d1ad2522b2146c29c7
msgid ""
"This means if you execute an RTL in Plane, it will return to the location "
"where it was when it was armed - assuming it had acquired GPS lock."
msgstr "这意味着如果您在 Plane 中执行 RTL，它将返回到解锁时所在的位置——前提是已获取 GPS 定位。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:33 a2c27a7bc0744bc0ad3b7b1cc7c7546a
msgid ""
"Consider the use of :ref:`Rally Points <common-rally-points>` to avoid "
"returning directly to your arming point on RTL."
msgstr "考虑使用 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>` 以避免 RTL 时直接返回解锁点。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:36 b3195d67013245168ad47b475b2d0c89
msgid "MISSION INTERRUPTION"
msgstr "任务中断"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:38 cb8fdd55ff694ec28f7673fc275fc83e
msgid ""
"Changing out of AUTO Mode leaves whatever mission item being executed in a "
"\"suspended\" state. Re-entry into AUTO mode later will either resume "
"execution of the mission where it was left or restart the mission depending "
"on the value of the :ref:`MIS_RESTART<MIS_RESTART>` parameter. By default, "
"it will resume. If you were on the way to Waypoint 3 when changed modes out "
"of AUTO, if re-entered, it will immediately head for Waypoint 3 and continue"
" the mission."
msgstr ""
"退出 AUTO 模式会使正在执行的任务项进入「暂停」状态。之后重新进入 AUTO 模式时，将根据 "
":ref:`MIS_RESTART<MIS_RESTART>` 参数的值恢复执行任务或从头重启任务。默认情况下将恢复。如果在前往航点 3 途中切换出 "
"AUTO 模式，重新进入后将立即前往航点 3 并继续任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/auto-mode.rst:40 175f80902d59428d8a6668ad05ae423e
msgid ""
"You can reset the mission back to the beginning using either the "
"``RCx_OPTION`` switch \"24\", or via a MAVLink command. Mission Planner has "
"a button in its \"Actions\" tab of the DATA screen to \"Restart Mission\". "
"If :ref:`MIS_RESTART<MIS_RESTART>` is set to \"1\", the the mission will be "
"reset to the start every time AUTO mode is entered."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关「24」或通过 MAVLink 命令将任务重置到开头。Mission Planner 在 DATA "
"界面的「Actions」选项卡中有「Restart Mission」按钮。若将 :ref:`MIS_RESTART<MIS_RESTART>` "
"设为「1」，每次进入 AUTO 模式时任务都将重置到开头。"
